Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.07,0:00:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.27,0:00:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,For you, King of Kings!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.63,0:01:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Copter One.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.01,0:01:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We've begun our descent\Ninto Kaiba Corp Stadium
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.97,0:01:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,for the commencement of\Nthe Battle City Finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.53,0:01:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,My competition, if you can call them that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.27,0:01:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,will be arriving soon, along with\Nthe two remaining Egyptian god cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.49,0:01:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that fool standing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.03,0:01:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon he will become a pawn\Nin his own pathetic game.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.45,0:01:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.65,0:01:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.13,0:01:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come to put the\Nfinal part of my plan into motion,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.93,0:01:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'll need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.55,0:01:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.87,0:01:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The Battle City Finals are about to begin,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.57,0:01:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,and everything that I need to gain\Ninfinite power will be in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.43,0:01:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,All we have to do now is win.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.85,0:01:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,For 5,000 years, the world has waited\Nfor the ancient Pharaoh to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.03,0:01:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,As the scriptures state,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.77,0:02:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,he will use his boundless power to rescue\Nthe world from evil, as he did before.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.97,0:02:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Wielding the strength\Nof the Egyptian gods,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.77,0:02:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,his spirit shall emerge\Nfrom within the chambers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.45,0:02:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,of the millennium puzzle\Nto rule mankind once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.51,0:02:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.99,0:02:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall fulfill that prophecy\NBy seizing the Millennium
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.19,0:02:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Puzzle and draining the\NPharaoh's power. But as you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.23,0:02:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Obelisk, the puzzle isn't all I need.\NAccording to the ancient scriptures,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.17,0:02:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,in order to possess the Pharaoh's\Npower One must also hold
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.71,0:02:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,all three Egyptian god cards\NOnce I accomplish this task,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.87,0:02:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be Pharaoh And the\Nformer ruler will wander the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.05,0:02:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Shadow Realm for eternity This\Nis where I need your help,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.11,0:02:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Odeon, I must hide my identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.33,0:02:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone shall think you are me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.91,0:02:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,As for myself, those fools already\Nbelieve me to be a friend named Namu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.47,0:02:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll gain their trust, then crush\Nthem with the winged dragon of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.97,0:03:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Go turn on the lights. Lights?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.47,0:03:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Illuminate the stadium right now. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.63,0:03:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn the lights on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.21,0:03:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Seto?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.07,0:03:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I heard something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.75,0:03:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No one should enter the stadium without\Nfirst reporting to me. Not to worry, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.63,0:03:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba. We'll locate any and all\Ntrespassers. Someone else is arriving.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.45,0:03:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.65,0:03:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The first three finalists\NJoey, Yugi, and Mai This is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.29,0:03:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is still under\Nconstruction. We're unfashionably
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.87,0:03:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,early Welcome Present your\Nlocator cards Check it out
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.05,0:03:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We all got six Then here are your\Ntournament IDs Congratulations
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.79,0:03:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You three are now officially\NBattle City finalists.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.37,0:03:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We already knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.85,0:03:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, security is tight, so make sure you\Nhave these cards with you at all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.27,0:03:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.18,0:03:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, where's everyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.21,0:03:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So far, it's just the three\Nof you and, of course, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.99,0:03:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.90,0:03:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We expect the other\Nfour finalists shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.61,0:03:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that it matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.95,0:03:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll all lose soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.91,0:04:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Here comes someone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.55,0:04:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, I've got a bad feeling\Nabout this. Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.71,0:04:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You think it's that evil creep, Marek?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.35,0:04:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.55,0:04:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be one of the eight finalists.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.69,0:04:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the end for you, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.23,0:04:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon the strongest power in the world\Nwill belong to me. Huh? Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.27,0:04:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute. I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.07,0:04:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Namu, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.61,0:04:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved Bakura's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.51,0:04:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad I could help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.81,0:04:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Bakura now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.51,0:04:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Resting in the hospital. Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.35,0:04:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything to help someone in need.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.21,0:04:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.53,0:04:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's something I don't\Ntrust about this guy With all of
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.49,0:04:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,these rare hunters running around\NI don't believe what anyone says
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.57,0:04:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So Joey It looks like we both made it\Nto the Battle City Finals Didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.93,0:04:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd get this\Nfar But since the day I met
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.03,0:04:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You two, I've been winning every\Nduel. So you'd better beware.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.31,0:04:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.22,0:05:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,meet our friend Namu He's the one\Nwho saved Bukora's life And get
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.51,0:05:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,this He's also one of the Battle\NCity Finalists Isn't that right,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.05,0:05:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.96,0:05:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.87,0:05:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, I, uh, yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.03,0:05:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard about you, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.97,0:05:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an honor to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.37,0:05:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Namu, thanks a lot for helping out Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.27,0:05:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Any friend of Joey and\NTaya's is a buddy of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.31,0:05:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy to be surrounded\Nby such a welcoming crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.37,0:05:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope everyone I meet tonight\Nis as friendly as you people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.17,0:05:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh, maybe he's not so bad\Nafter all. What do I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.35,0:05:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.26,0:05:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's Bakura!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.89,0:05:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.63,0:05:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.57,0:05:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You should get back to the hospital
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.81,0:05:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura, you should\Nreally be resting. Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.81,0:05:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa told me you were in pretty\Nbad condition They let you out?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.59,0:05:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine. Look, Bakura,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.93,0:05:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how you found us here But\Nyou better get back to that hospital Wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.11,0:05:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,what are you doing wearing a dual disc?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.03,0:05:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How else could I win six locator\Ncards and enter the finals?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.59,0:06:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.15,0:06:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect, he's holding up his end of\Nour bargain The fool is dueling for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.71,0:06:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.73,0:06:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura could barely walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.11,0:06:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd he win six locator cards?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.11,0:06:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, rewind a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.59,0:06:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you join the tournament?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.07,0:06:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Join?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.98,0:06:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you make it all\Nthe way to the finals?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.41,0:06:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This is freaking me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.77,0:06:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.68,0:06:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the seventh finalist.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.93,0:06:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy looks familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.77,0:06:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's a mug you don't forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.69,0:06:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,He must hold the third Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.91,0:06:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.31,0:06:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the one who kidnapped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.45,0:06:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,State your name right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.45,0:06:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.05,0:06:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kick your brainwashing keister.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.63,0:06:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You are no match for me, fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.77,0:06:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The only reason I'm not tossing\Nyou out by your cape right
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.67,0:06:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,now is so I can save my energy\Nto take you down in the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.27,0:06:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Got that, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.59,0:07:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I should disqualify you right now for\Ncapturing my little brother, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.53,0:07:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But you have something that I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.09,0:07:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And before the finals are over,\Nyour Egyptian god card will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.13,0:07:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't look like you have too many\Nfriends around here, tattoo face.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.99,0:07:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I scared him, Yug.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.65,0:07:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.71,0:07:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I have your attention, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.29,0:07:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Seven out of eight of you are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.35,0:07:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So now it's time to announce that\Nalthough your locator cards led you here,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.19,0:07:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,this is not the site of\Nthe Battle City finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.15,0:07:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The actual tournament arena should be\Narriving here any second now, folks. I'm lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.03,0:07:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are the finals?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.79,0:07:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.43,0:07:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Kaiba's blimp.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.49,0:07:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.95,0:07:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.09,0:07:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll all be boarding shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.71,0:07:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba Craft 3, you're\Ncleared for landing. Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.57,0:07:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So we're dueling in the sky? You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.83,0:08:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, 4,000 feet in\Nthe sky to be exact.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.97,0:08:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You got boff bags on board? Just checking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.79,0:08:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.45,0:08:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to board Kaiba Corp 3 for\Nthe start of the Battle City Finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.35,0:08:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll depart as soon as\Nthe 8th Duelist arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.61,0:08:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Climb aboard and watch your step.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.11,0:08:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A girl could definitely get\Nused to this kind of treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.17,0:08:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder who the 8th Finalist is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.35,0:08:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, yeah, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.73,0:08:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm kicking butt on a blimp.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.85,0:08:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.76,0:08:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let you four on board without\Ntournament IDs. No way! Come on! Please, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.09,0:08:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been looking forward to actually\Nseeing my big brother duel for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.51,0:08:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut her some slack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.73,0:08:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, what's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.23,0:08:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.33,0:08:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.37,0:08:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Just this once?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.39,0:08:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It is against the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.99,0:08:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it a rest, Roland.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.33,0:08:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We can bend the rules for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.91,0:08:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have an ID card.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.63,0:08:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But they're Mr. Kaiba's\Nrules. Well, big bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.49,0:08:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.61,0:08:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, sounds like a yes to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.55,0:09:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let the dweebs go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.09,0:09:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.59,0:09:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Begin takeoff immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.65,0:09:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.56,0:09:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, the final duelist hasn't arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.33,0:09:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, the Egyptian god\Nguards are already on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.49,0:09:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure you want to do this, Seto?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.31,0:09:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.71,0:09:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We follow Mr. Kaiba's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.91,0:09:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.83,0:09:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be the eighth finalist.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.67,0:09:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to save you, my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.55,0:09:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe you gentlemen are waiting for\Nme, my Locator Guard. Welcome. Follow us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.13,0:09:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It has begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.31,0:09:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The final confrontation is upon us, and\Nthe fate of the world hangs in the balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.27,0:09:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba Craft 3, prepare for liftoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.83,0:09:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,All thrusters are engaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.17,0:09:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We have liftoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.75,0:10:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Rotate engines for forward propulsion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.49,0:10:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We have reached the\Nofficial dueling altitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.29,0:10:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.99,0:10:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen the\Ncity from this high up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.31,0:10:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The lights are so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.27,0:10:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for bringing me, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.01,0:10:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one of the many perks of\Nbeing related to a champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.33,0:10:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You call yourself a champion, Wheeler?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.91,0:10:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You're here by a fluke.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.65,0:10:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep walking, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.85,0:10:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy this while you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.09,0:10:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And listen, I wouldn't get\Nyour hopes up too high,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.01,0:10:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,because it's a long way down from up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.15,0:10:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and the last time I\Nchecked, monkeys can't fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.31,0:10:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.22,0:10:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's he calling a monkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.19,0:10:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, I have some words\Nof advice for you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.81,0:10:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm aware that you haven't played your\NEgyptian god card since you won it,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.01,0:10:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's time for that to\Nend right here and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.93,0:10:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So it had better be in your deck during\Nthe finals because I intend to win it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.55,0:11:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my tournament, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.35,0:11:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.26,0:11:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And then when the Battle\NCity finals are all over,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.97,0:11:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be the world's greatest duelist and\Nthe owner of all three Egyptian God cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.31,0:11:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,making my deck unbeatable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.15,0:11:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's time to say your goodbyes\Nto Slifer the Sky Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.51,0:11:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And to any hopes you had of\Nwinning, Listen to me closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.95,0:11:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Duelist Kingdom is far away, and\Nas long as you're up here with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.45,0:11:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,you're playing my game by my rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.07,0:11:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, if you'll excuse me,\NI have a tournament to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.07,0:11:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, this balloon is full of hot air.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.95,0:11:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention, Battle City finalists.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.93,0:11:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Please report to your assigned rooms\Nwhich you'll access with your ID cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.57,0:11:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.93,0:11:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Check out our deluxe pad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.83,0:11:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, what a great view.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.57,0:11:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's so awesome. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.25,0:11:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If it hadn't been for you, Joey, I\Nwouldn't be able to see all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.07,0:12:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.99,0:12:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But you can, and that's what matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.15,0:12:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't think of anywhere\Nelse I'd rather be right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.91,0:12:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's kind of like a dream, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.41,0:12:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Up here in the sky, looking\Ndown on all of the buildings.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.35,0:12:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget this sight. Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.63,0:12:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.61,0:12:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.33,0:12:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.89,0:12:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who should be\Nthanking you for all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.11,0:12:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the greatest\Nbrother and my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.91,0:12:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,My allergies are acting up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.67,0:12:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But I couldn't have gotten\Nhere without your help, sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.19,0:12:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We're a good team.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.23,0:12:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.31,0:12:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Big bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.43,0:12:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm gonna win this thing\Nwith your support, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.43,0:12:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No way am I gonna let Kaiba\Nor anyone else discourage me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.43,0:12:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta stay focused and not\Nlet anything distract me from...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.85,0:12:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, I think Yugi's room is bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.07,0:12:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.98,0:12:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys never heard of a doorbell?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.09,0:12:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We needed somewhere to crash while\Nthey tried to find some rooms for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.29,0:12:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's see here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.73,0:13:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no idea how hard it is to find\Nthis kind of cheese. Let's chow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.43,0:13:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Room service on Joey. Sure, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.33,0:13:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my room, you moochies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.89,0:13:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.87,0:13:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Be a good sport. You're hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.75,0:13:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.91,0:13:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to prepare for\Nmy duels with all this going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.93,0:13:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll ask Serenity if she wants to\Ncheck out the romantic view with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.49,0:13:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.25,0:13:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Serenity, want to check out the view?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.87,0:13:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.13,0:13:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That was my line.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.03,0:13:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.51,0:13:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, we're flying right\Nover my gaming shop. Oh, cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.95,0:13:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey there, big guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.47,0:13:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry that we bum-rushed\Nyour family time like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.27,0:13:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't have to be sorry if\Nhe didn't come in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.07,0:13:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Go bother Yugi. Nah,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.01,0:13:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,we wanted to make sure he had some peace\Nand quiet before the finals started, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.39,0:14:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dueling too, you know. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.85,0:14:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.67,0:14:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.95,0:14:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And by the way, thank you. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.39,0:14:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,For taking care of my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.45,0:14:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Just helping out, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.41,0:14:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it means a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.09,0:14:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Anytime. I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.01,0:14:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.05,0:14:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.59,0:14:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.77,0:14:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you two think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.95,0:14:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We're informing Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.39,0:14:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba about the late arrival,\Nthe Eighth Duelist. You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.15,0:14:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be surprised if\Nmy brother fired you jokers
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.05,0:14:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,for interrupting him while\Nhe's trying to prep for a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.03,0:14:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yes, sir. Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.67,0:14:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, the moment I've been\Nwaiting for is about to arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.59,0:14:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,With this one card,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.25,0:14:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Obelisk the Tormenter,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.73,0:14:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I will destroy both Yugi and Marek\Nand gain their Egyptian God cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.31,0:14:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I wield all three,\NI'll be unbeatable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.59,0:15:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I may have missed out on winning\Nthe Duelist Kingdom finals,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.45,0:15:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,but this time I know\Nthat I'll be victorious
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.73,0:15:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It is my sworn duty to win for Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.49,0:15:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick I promise that I will not fail him
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.81,0:15:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My victory in the Battle\NCity Finals is inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.13,0:15:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I've manipulated so\Nmany people, I can't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.75,0:15:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi believes me to be on his side while I
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.95,0:15:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,secretly control the minds of his friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.83,0:15:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And when the time is right,\NI will seize that control.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.85,0:15:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Then there's Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.73,0:15:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather than waste my energy\Ncontrolling his mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.75,0:15:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I fooled the spirit of the Millennium\NRing into using Bakura to duel for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.51,0:15:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So before long,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.49,0:16:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,the three Egyptian god cards as well\Nas the Millennium Puzzle will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.91,0:16:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Only then can I obtain the boundless\Npower of the pharaoh himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.43,0:16:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And the best part is, I can't lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.69,0:16:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,With Odeon and Bakura dueling for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.05,0:16:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,and Yugi believing me to be\Nhis kind-hearted friend Namu,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.51,0:16:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,victory will surely be mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.11,0:16:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If I honestly expect to stop Merrick\Nfrom getting what he wants, I have
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.71,0:16:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,to do what kaiba said and put slifer\Nthe sky dragon in my deck but it's a
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.85,0:16:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,really powerful card and using it\Ncould be very dangerous so i'm going to
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.05,0:16:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,have to be careful all right no matter\Nwhat happens i've got to believe in my
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.31,0:16:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Deck and in myself. You made the correct\Ndecision, Yugi. In order to save the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.49,0:16:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,world from destruction we're going\Nto need that card you're right slifer
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.93,0:16:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,the sky dragon will help us defeat the\Negyptian god card held by merrick as
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.37,0:17:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,well as prevent him from winning the\None held by kaiba babosk the tormentor
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.83,0:17:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,the battle city finals\Nwill be an epic clash
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.77,0:17:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Between these three Egyptian\Ngods, but we must triumph.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.83,0:17:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,well that's not the only\Nthing i'm worried about
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.59,0:17:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,i've got a bad feeling about\Nbakura go on how did he
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.15,0:17:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,recover so quickly and\Nbecome a battle city finalist
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.91,0:17:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,unless the person on board\Nisn't bakura bakura why
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.15,0:17:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,have you taken us to the\Nshadow realm bakura bakura
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.79,0:17:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It is no longer here.\NIf you're not Bakura,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.19,0:17:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,then who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.25,0:17:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a thief and a stealer of souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.49,0:17:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Whosoever wields all seven Millennium\Nitems will possess power unimaginable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.85,0:17:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Bakura, but that ring's gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.43,0:17:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But Tristan got rid of the\NMillennium Ring in Duelist Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.93,0:18:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So how could the evil spirit that\Nonce controlled Bakura be back again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.35,0:18:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't predict the\Npath of a Millennium Item.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.23,0:18:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The ring must have found its\Nway back to Bakura. Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.27,0:18:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now winning will be even harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.25,0:18:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.75,0:18:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.85,0:18:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The fate of the whole world depends on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.43,0:18:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but many dangers lie ahead, so\Nwe have to be prepared for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.93,0:18:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.29,0:18:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's up to fate now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.75,0:18:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention, duelists.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.91,0:18:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The Battle City finals\Nare about to begin. Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.47,0:18:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba requests the presence of\Nall finalists in the main hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.91,0:18:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.17,0:18:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,All right now, you guys. Let's go! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.65,0:18:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Winners first, Monkey Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.67,0:18:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd you say, tough guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.49,0:18:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you better walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.45,0:18:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.87,0:18:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Namu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.99,0:19:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Before we begin, let me just say\Nmay the best man win. I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.25,0:19:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And let me just say I hope you're not\Ntoo disappointed when I beat you, Namu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.73,0:19:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I admire your determination,\NJoey. Let's go. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.03,0:19:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.05,0:19:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to win duels and take names.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.33,0:19:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey Wheeler's going to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.53,0:19:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.69,0:19:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The fate of the world depends\Non me and the heart of the card.
